Codex Standalone Linux

Backend modules and regression tests are derived from the Codex console plugin
in ElementsPanel-Codex-Console, commit 50e3083 (Apache-2.0).
Original project: ElementsPanel/ElementsPanel (Apache-2.0).
Modified: standalone authentication, HTTP lifecycle, streaming, deployment and UI.
No ElementsPanel runtime, database, plugin host or frontend is required.
Not an official OpenAI application.
